22 (high risk) = Red (#ef4444)&#xa;      • 2023 (medium risk) = Yellow (#f59e0b)&#xa;      • 2024 (low risk) = Green (#10b981)&#xa;  - Tooltip on hover: Shows return_percentage&#xa;&#xa;Total Returns Calculation (Stat Card #2):&#xa;  Current Value: $138,400 (from live investment_accounts table)&#xa;  Initial Value: $82,000 (earliest snapshot from 2021)&#xa;  Total Returns: $138,400 - $82,000 = $56,400&#xa;  &#xa;  Note: UI shows $48,200, adjust accordingly based on actual initial investment&#xa;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;Apple-interchange-newline&quot;&gt;" id="E-T9R8gTJTS1snVM30RU-17">
