        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="E-T9R8gTJTS1snVM30RU-19" value="&lt;h2 class=&quot;xor4psk x1ncjjhx xaoa4km xdod15v x14terfx x134cssr xzboxd6&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 550; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21px; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Arial, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, SFProLocalRange; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: inherit; outline: none; letter-spacing: -0.07504px; text-decoration: none; cursor: inherit; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(44, 44, 44);&quot;&gt;❌ NO OTHER TABLES NEEDED&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;xvwc6ox x4z9k3i x1j61x8r x15m7nig xdod15v x22v61l x4vex6e xzboxd6&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 450; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13px; line-height: 21px; font-family: Inter; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: inherit; outline: none; letter-spacing: -0.032px; text-decoration: none; cursor: inherit; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(44, 44, 44);&quot;&gt;All other UI data is calculated at runtime using SQL queries:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;x1v8gsql x4p5aij x1j85h84 xf00w7v x1d60ukw x15klxpg x1hjwid2 x192jxwq x126k92a x1mzt3pk x4vex6e xzboxd6&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 1px 0.25rem; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 450; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12.22px; line-height: inherit; font-family: source-code-pro, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: inherit; outline: none; letter-spacing: 0.065px; text-decoration: none; cursor: inherit; border-radius: 2px; background-color: rgb(56, 56, 56); overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;x1v8gsql xtczco7 x4p5aij x1j85h84 xf00w7v x1d60ukw x15klxpg x1hjwid2 x192jxwq&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 1px 0.25rem; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11.4868px; line-height: inherit; font-family: source-code-pro, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: inherit; outline: none; letter-spacing: inherit; text-decoration: none; cursor: inherit; border-radius: 2px; background-color: rgb(56, 56, 56); color: rgb(124, 196, 248);&quot;&gt;┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐&#xa;│ CALCULATED AT RUNTIME (No Storage Required)                             │&#xa;├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤&#xa;│                                                                           │&#xa;│ ✅ Total Portfolio Value (Stat Card #1: $244,400)                       │&#xa;│    SQL:                                                                  │&#xa;│      SELECT SUM(current_value)                                           │&#xa;│      FROM investment_accounts                                            │&#xa;│      WHERE user_id = ? AND is_active = true                              │&#xa;│                                                                           │&#xa;│    Why Runtime: Simple aggregation, always accurate, no sync overhead   │&#xa;│                                                                           │&#xa;│ ✅ Total Returns (Stat Card #2: +$48,200)                                │&#xa;│    SQL:                                                                  │&#xa;│      SELECT                                                              │&#xa;│        (SELECT SUM(current_value)                                        │&#xa;│         FROM investment_accounts                                         │&#xa;│         WHERE user_id = ? AND is_active = true) -                        │&#xa;│        (SELECT portfolio_value                                           │&#xa;│         FROM investment_performance_snapshots                            │&#xa;│         WHERE user_id = ?                                                │&#xa;│         ORDER BY snapshot_year ASC                                       │&#xa;│         LIMIT 1)                                                         │&#xa;│                                                                           │&#xa;│    Why Runtime: Uses current live data + earliest snapshot              │&#xa;│                                                                           │&#xa;│ ✅ Portfolio Risk Level (Stat Card #3: &quot;Low-Medium&quot;)                     │&#xa;│    Logic:                                                                │&#xa;│      total = SUM(current_value) WHERE is_active = true                   │&#xa;│      FOR EACH account:                                                   │&#xa;│        weight = account.current_value / total                            │&#xa;│        score += risk_to_number(account.risk_level) × weight             │&#xa;│      result = number_to_risk_label(score)                                │&#xa;│                                                                           │&#xa;│    Why Runtime: Changes every time account values update                │&#xa;│                                                                           │&#xa;│ ✅ Allocation Percentages (Account Breakdown: &quot;35%&quot;)                     │&#xa;│    SQL:                                                                  │&#xa;│      SELECT account_name, current_value,                                 │&#xa;│        (current_value / SUM(current_value) OVER ()) * 100 AS pct         │&#xa;│      FROM investment_accounts                                            │&#xa;│      WHERE user_id = ? AND is_active = true                              │&#xa;│                                                                           │&#xa;│    Why Runtime: Percentages change with every account value update      │&#xa;│                                                                           │&#xa;└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="E-T9R8gTJTS1snVM30RU-31" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="178.33333333333331" width="530" height="891.6666666666666" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="E-T9R8gTJTS1snVM30RU-21" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 100px;&quot;&gt;Notes about Data that is not stored in Data base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="E-T9R8gTJTS1snVM30RU-31" vertex="1">
