                <mxCell id="H3DCpCM3TB73iOrC_Rii-14" value="&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px; color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;yet , there are Things that are not covered in flowchart&amp;nbsp; until now&amp;nbsp; (Still thinking about them) :&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Adaptive alerting system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;– Detect unusual spending, monitor goal progress, send context-aware email alerts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Financial dashboards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;– Interactive visual dashboards for spending, goals, trends.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;What-if financial simulations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;– User-run simulations to test scenarios.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Full AI–LangChain pipeline details&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;– Multi-step chained prompts, JSON validation, CFP-standards checking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Testing, debugging, iterative refinement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;– Part of methodology but not shown in the flow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whi