erit; outline: none; letter-spacing: 0.065px; text-decoration: none; cursor: inherit; border-radius: 2px; background-color: rgb(56, 56, 56); overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;x1v8gsql xtczco7 x4p5aij x1j85h84 xf00w7v x1d60ukw x15klxpg x1hjwid2 x192jxwq&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 1px 0.25rem; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11.4868px; line-height: inherit; font-family: source-code-pro, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: inherit; outline: none; letter-spacing: inherit; text-decoration: none; cursor: inherit; border-radius: 2px; background-color: rgb(56, 56, 56); color: rgb(124, 196, 248);&quot;&gt;Backend Cron Job Configuration:&#xa;  - Frequency: Annually&#xa;  - Run Time: January 1st at 2:00 AM&#xa;  - Captures: Previous year-end data (December 31st)&#xa;  &#xa;Example Timeline:&#xa;  - Jan 1, 2025 02:00 AM → Creates snapshot for year 2024 (date: 2024-12-31)&#xa;  - Jan 1, 2026 02:00 AM → Creates snapshot for year 2025 (date: 2025-12-31)&#xa;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;xvwc6ox x4z9k3i x1j61x8r x15m7nig xdod15v x22v61l x4vex6e xzboxd6&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 450; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13px; line-height: 21px; font-family: Inter; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-s